  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 20,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "to you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B14909C97E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 101,
        "text": "What I want to talk to you about today is virtual worlds, digital globes, the 3-D Web, the Metaverse.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "12FBCE9F39",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "What does this all mean for us?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "023641FF7B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "What it means is the Web is going to become an exciting place again.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "43E3A1D714",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "It's going to become super exciting as we transform to this highly immersive and interactive world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2A357AEDF3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 128,
        "endOffset": 138,
        "text": "your lives",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0EC49581DF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 139,
        "text": "With graphics, computing power, low latencies, these types of applications and possibilities are going to stream rich data into your lives.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "35645684E8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 107,
        "endOffset": 122,
        "text": "search metaphor",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E0DDF9FE5E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 123,
        "text": "So the Virtual Earth initiative, and other types of these initiatives, are all about extending our current search metaphor.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "479A073686",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "When you think about it, we're so constrained by browsing the Web, remembering URLs, saving favorites.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AC555A258F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 6,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "move to search, we rely on the relevance rankings, the Web matching, the index crawling",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "50443145DB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "As we move to search, we rely on the relevance rankings, the Web matching, the index crawling.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "27C18147E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "But we want to use our brain!",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6866A94895",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "We want to navigate, explore, discover information.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "98CA23F79C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 36,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "you as a user",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "557F7199B6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "In order to do that, we have to put you as a user back in the driver's seat.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "11BECF8350",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "We need cooperation between you and the computing network and the computer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1BB989A4E1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 26,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "you back in the driver's seat",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "05909C90FE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "So what better way to put you back in the driver's seat than to put you in the real world that you interact in every day?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CCB7BE9C42",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 36,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "you've been learning",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F032931440",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "Why not leverage the learnings that you've been learning your entire life?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D31D89CCB8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "So Virtual Earth is about starting off creating the first digital representation, comprehensive, of the entire world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D05FB26625",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "What we want to do is mix in all types of data.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "43FE35CBB5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 7,
        "text": "Tag it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D510A341BD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "Attribute it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F254F56C0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 9,
        "text": "Metadata.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "007DC257BD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "Get the community to add local depth, global perspective, local knowledge.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E51F4548C0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "So when you think about this problem, what an enormous undertaking.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "60E67DC943",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "Where do you begin?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A0AAA71F40",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "Well, we collect data from satellites, from airplanes, from ground vehicles, from people.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "72CC258C60",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "This process is an engineering problem, a mechanical problem, a logistical problem, an operational problem.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8D91498CAB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Here is an example of our aerial camera.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0A0F1BC6B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "This is panchromatic.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0CB0D9CFA1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "It's actually four color cones.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "24491AEDCF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "In addition, it's multi-spectral.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6ABA90A645",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 101,
        "text": "We collect four gigabits per second of data, if you can imagine that kind of data stream coming down.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4D3466C585",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "That's equivalent to a constellation of 12 satellites at highest res capacity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "256BC5843D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "We fly these airplanes at 5,000 feet in the air.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D71207581A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "You can see the camera on the front.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "32574CE246",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "We collect multiple viewpoints, vantage points, angles, textures.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "16453F0DE7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "We bring all that data back in.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "823598DDEF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 77,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "what do you see in person?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AA81D18B5E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "We need to capture that up close to establish that what it's like-type experience.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4ABB37EE23",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 51,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "kind of poking at the PC for their brilliance and simplicity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "49FAC9F732",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "did you see the one with the guy, he’s got the Web cam?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "62BA23F029",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "The poor PC guy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C365B1C9F6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "They're duct taping his head.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9071AC21E7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "They're just wrapping it on him.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "983F2740B1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "Well, a little unknown secret is his brother actually works on the Virtual Earth team.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "803197CF2E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 11,
        "text": "(Laughter).",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "169C1FFFD3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "So they've got a little bit of a sibling rivalry thing going on here.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BFEB9C971A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "But let me tell you -- it doesn't affect his day job.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AE373B50C8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "We think a lot of good can come from this technology.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C0C5692265",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "This was after Katrina.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "48D9FFE417",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "We were the first commercial fleet of airplanes to be cleared into the disaster impact zone.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4BD3FE0594",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 17,
        "text": "We flew the area.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "53E5E398A2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "We imaged it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "702AA2BEC6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "We sent in people.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BFE06FAAFB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 31,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "disaster areas",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7F351D9C03",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "We helped with the first responders, the search and rescue.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5C572E10F8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "Often the first time anyone saw what happened to their house was on Virtual Earth.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "69E79ADB60",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "We made it all freely available on the Web, just to -- it was obviously our chance of helping out with the cause.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "192123516C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "When we think about how all this comes together, it's all about software, algorithms and math.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E7728A119",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "You know",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "862D0E24A1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 10,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "we capture this imagery but to build the 3-D models we need to do geo-positioning.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6657755982",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "We need to do geo-registering of the images.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8120EE45F9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "We have to bundle adjust them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BE02FAFF6D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "Find tie points.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "941FF8305E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "Extract geometry from the images.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "79B3D7EB93",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "This process is a very calculated process.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E8D2CBEE83",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "In fact, it was always done manual.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "592EAE8F59",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "Hollywood would spend millions of dollars to do a small urban corridor for a movie because they'd have to do it manually.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CD3277EB1E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "They'd drive the streets with lasers called LIDAR.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "379FCCFC09",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "They'd collected information with photos.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C93BC18C1C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "They'd manually build each building.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3B8BCC6A49",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "We do this all through software, algorithms and math -- a highly automated pipeline creating these cities.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0AAC0B9752",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 150,
        "text": "We took a decimal point off what it cost to build these cities, and that's how we're going to be able to scale this out and make this reality a dream.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1C44DA634B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "We think about the user interface.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BF2D7EE502",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "What does it mean to look at it from multiple perspectives?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F28F52D39F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "An ortho-view, a nadir-view.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8D19D47E46",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "How do you keep the precision of the fidelity of the imagery while maintaining the fluidity of the model?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F8315ED03E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "I'll wrap up by showing you the -- this is a brand-new peek I haven't really shown into the lab area of Virtual Earth.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3EFC7D2F87",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "What we're doing is -- people like this a lot, this bird's eye imagery we work with.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "27A70889E4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "It's this high resolution data.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "83E19E54E5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 38,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "fluidity",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1906A6F86E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "But what we've found is they like the fluidity of the 3-D model.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F88E7A2A4F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "A child can navigate with an Xbox controller or a game controller.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "38BED18918",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "So here what we're trying to do is we bring the picture and project it into the 3-D model space.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "59E0DE6E8E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "You can see all types of resolution.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "33FAF6D291",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "From here, I can slowly pan the image over.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F08F20AC3A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "I can get the next image.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6F54A3CD2D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "I can blend and transition.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F0F5779128",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "83",
        "end": "83",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "By doing this I don't lose the original detail.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BBBE4F7532",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "84",
        "end": "84",
        "startOffset": 20,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "recording history",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8B223DE239",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "84",
        "end": "84",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "In fact, I might be recording history.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1E2532F019",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "85",
        "end": "85",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "The freshness, the capacity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A880C48BCC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "86",
        "end": "86",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "I can turn this image.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "68AB504D03",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "87",
        "end": "87",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "I can look at it from multiple viewpoints and angles.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2D40954C94",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "88",
        "end": "88",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "What we're trying to do is build a virtual world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "38CD1AD940",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "89",
        "end": "89",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "you're familiar with",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "460C95FD6E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "89",
        "end": "89",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B84E55CEC5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "89",
        "end": "89",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0BF2FF0E54",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "89",
        "end": "89",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 137,
        "text": "We hope that we can make computing a user model you're familiar with, and really derive insights from you, from all different directions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8E244D1BAA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "90",
        "end": "90",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "I thank you very much for your time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0CE7C26C8B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "91",
        "end": "91",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1C1AB7540D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}